{"voice": "am_adam", "speed": 1.08, "lines": [{"id": "L01", "text": "His lifeline snapped nearly a hundred metres under the North Sea.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S01", "emphasis": ["lifeline", "snapped"]}, {"id": "L02", "text": "He had about five minutes of gas on his back.", "pause_after": 0.25, "shot": "S02", "emphasis": ["five", "minutes"]}, {"id": "L03", "text": "North Sea, September 2012.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S03", "emphasis": ["2012"]}, {"id": "L04", "text": "Chris Lemons, a saturation diver, was working on the seabed.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S04", "emphasis": ["Chris", "Lemons", "saturation"]}, {"id": "L05", "text": "Above him, his support ship's positioning system failed.", "pause_after": 0.1, "shot": "S05", "emphasis": ["failed"]}, {"id": "L06", "text": "In rough seas, it drifted.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S06", "emphasis": ["drifted"]}, {"id": "L07", "text": "His umbilical, carrying his gas and his radio, snagged on steel.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S07", "emphasis": ["umbilical", "snagged"]}, {"id": "L08", "text": "Then it parted.", "pause_after": 0.4, "shot": "S08", "emphasis": ["parted"]}, {"id": "L09", "text": "In total darkness, he pulled himself back to the structure.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S09", "emphasis": ["darkness", "structure"]}, {"id": "L10", "text": "Then his emergency gas ran out.", "pause_after": 0.6, "shot": "S10", "emphasis": ["ran", "out"]}, {"id": "L11", "text": "It would take around half an hour to reach him.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S11", "emphasis": ["half", "an", "hour"]}, {"id": "L12", "text": "When Dave Yuasa got there, Lemons was unresponsive.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S12", "emphasis": ["Dave", "Yuasa", "unresponsive"]}, {"id": "L13", "text": "He hauled him back into the diving bell.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S13", "emphasis": ["diving", "bell"]}, {"id": "L14", "text": "There, Duncan Allcock gave him rescue breaths.", "pause_after": 0.45, "shot": "S14", "emphasis": ["Duncan", "Allcock", "rescue", "breaths"]}, {"id": "L15", "text": "And Chris Lemons started breathing again.", "pause_after": 0.3, "shot": "S15", "emphasis": ["breathing"]}, {"id": "L16", "text": "The leading theory: the cold.", "pause_after": 0.1, "shot": "S16", "emphasis": ["cold"]}, {"id": "L17", "text": "Near-freezing water chilled him, slowing his brain's need for oxygen.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S17", "emphasis": ["Near-freezing", "oxygen"]}, {"id": "L18", "text": "No one can prove it.", "pause_after": 0.3, "shot": "S18", "emphasis": ["prove"]}, {"id": "L19", "text": "Three weeks later, he was back at work.", "pause_after": 0.0, "shot": "S19", "emphasis": ["Three", "weeks"]}]}